iled to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 AUG 98 at 14 13 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast lesion  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a localizing guide wire  It is inked and sectioned to reveal a 2 0cm in diameter firm white nodule with irregular borders abutting the inked margins  A representative section of the nodule is frozen as FX 1  now in cassette A  The rest of the specimen entirely submitted in cassettes B through D  Gross Description by  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
