mas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 15 27 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass  is an unoriented fibroadipose tissue  measuring 6 x REMOVED_DATE x 2cm  Inked and sectioned to reveal an ill defined aggregate of tan white  firm  focally gritty nodules measuring 6 x 2 x 2 5cm  present at multiple resection margins  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A through J  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary node  is a 6 x 5 x 1cm fragment of fatty adipose tissue  The lymph nodes are dissected and submitted entirely in cassettes K through T  Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Lawrence T Geoghegan  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION , No.
