ative nipple  L  Representative hemorrhagic cavity  M N  One lymph node bisected  O V  Each  one lymph node bisected  W Y  Lymph nodes and fat  Resident  STACEY L  MIKESELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No.
